{
 "items": [
  {
   "id": "l01",
   "text": "有个学生，把练习册的答案一字不落，全背了下来。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l02",
   "text": "练习册上的题，他次次满分；可一到考试，题目稍微换个样子，他就不会了。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l03",
   "text": "人工智能也会犯一模一样的毛病。它有个名字，叫过拟合，英文是 overfitting。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l04",
   "text": "先看模型在干什么。这十个点，是我们收集到的数据，叫训练数据。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l05",
   "text": "它们大致沿着某个规律分布，但每个点都带着一点随机的偏差，也就是噪声。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l06",
   "text": "模型的任务，是从这些点里找出规律，好去预测它没见过的新数据。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l07",
   "text": "第一种，模型太简单，只会画直线。连训练数据都对不上，这叫欠拟合。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l08",
   "text": "第二种，一条平缓的曲线。它没有穿过每一个点，但抓住了大的走势。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l09",
   "text": "第三种，模型非常复杂，曲线拐来拐去，硬是穿过了每一个点。在训练数据上，它的误差是零。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l10",
   "text": "只看练习册，第三种最好。真是这样吗？",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l11",
   "text": "我们拿出六个模型从没见过的新点，这叫测试数据，相当于考试。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l12",
   "text": "第二种曲线，离新点都不远，考得不错。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l13",
   "text": "第三种曲线，在点和点之间乱拐。有的新点正好落在拐弯处，一下就差出去很远。这一次，它的测试误差是第二种的二十多倍。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l14",
   "text": "它没有学到规律，而是把训练数据里的噪声，也一起背了下来。这就是过拟合。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l15",
   "text": "我们把这个实验重复三百次，看模型从简单到复杂，两种误差怎么变。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l16",
   "text": "训练误差一路往下走：模型越复杂，练习题做得越好。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l17",
   "text": "测试误差却先降后升。中间那一段，才是真正学到了规律。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l18",
   "text": "所以，训练误差很低、测试误差却很高，就是过拟合的信号。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l19",
   "text": "那该怎么发现和避免过拟合？常用的办法有三个。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    2
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l20",
   "text": "第一，再留出一份数据当模拟考，叫验证集：用它来挑模型、及早发现过拟合，真正的考试留到最后。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l21",
   "text": "第二，收集更多的数据，噪声就不容易被当成规律。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l22",
   "text": "第三，限制模型的复杂度，别让它有本事把每个点都背下来。这类方法叫正则化。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    2
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l23",
   "text": "记住这一句：过拟合，就是把答案背下来了，却没学会规律。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "l24",
   "text": "下一集，我们讲另一个高频词：强化学习。",
   "reference": [
    "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/audio/voice_ref/teacher_m_s1.wav"
   ],
   "language": "Chinese",
   "seeds": [
    1
   ]
  }
 ]
}